From: Project Luma <builds@project-luma.local>
Subject: [PATCH] luma: pack every clock-side island against the clock

With the media player and a live extension island both on the shelf, only
the gap before the status cluster was pinned, so the live island took half
the slack on each side and floated between the dock and the player. The
islands that belong to the clock now pack against it as one group, and the
slack goes to the gap by the dock.

--- a/js/ui/mediaSelection.js
+++ b/js/ui/mediaSelection.js
@@ -43,31 +43,37 @@
